  /// The ARN of the IAM role that you want the Firehose stream to use to
  /// create endpoints in the destination VPC. You can use your existing
  /// Firehose delivery role or you can specify a new role. In either case,
  /// make sure that the role trusts the Firehose service principal and that
  /// it grants the following permissions: ec2:DescribeVpcs
  /// ec2:DescribeVpcAttribute ec2:DescribeSubnets ec2:DescribeSecurityGroups
